OL,3,GNEWSACommittee recruits island-voice
OL,4,Afor assisted dying
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the committee responsible
OL,7,Ffor overseeing how assisted dying is
OL,8,Fintroduced in Jersey are looking for a
OL,9,Fmember of the public with end-of-life
OL,10,Fcare experience to join them.
OL,12,FThe Assisted Dying (Jersey) Law 2026
OL,13,Fwas given Royal Assent in July but due
OL,14,Fto a minimum 18-month implementation
OL,15,Fperiod, the Government of Jersey said
OL,16,Fit anticipated the earliest date the
OL,17,Flaw would come into effect would be
OL,18,FSeptember 2027.b@K
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
