OL,3,GNEWSACommittee recruits island-voice
OL,4,Afor assisted dying
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Sarah Wollaston was appointed to
OL,7,Flead the committee supervising the
OL,8,Fimplementation of Jersey's Assisted
OL,9,FDying Service in September.
OL,11,FShe said the islander joining the
OL,12,Fcommittee would be to represent "a
OL,13,Fwhole range of experiences from
OL,14,Fcommunities across the island".
